\item[* relevant literature/documents:]
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\
Perhaps some problems exist when an element out of the embedded NP must be 
shifted, e.g.\ in questions: What does he hate buying? These problems have not 
been dealt with yet. Probably, openIngNPs should also be SENTENCEs (cf.\ the 
situation in ADJPPROPs, where the subject openIngNP seems to be able to 
extrapose, as only SENTENCEs do: It was not easy getting the equipment loaded; 
cf.\ the remarks made under ....).
\item modifications:\\

\end{enumerate}
\end{description}

